sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Alice as Sender (Alice)
    participant AliceApp as Alice Flutter App
    participant Realtime as services/realtime Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant BobApp as Bob Flutter App
    actor Bob as Recipient (Bob)

    Alice->>AliceApp: Type & Send "Namaste"
    AliceApp->>AliceApp: Encrypt Payload locally (AES-GCM E2EE)
    AliceApp->>Realtime: WSS ENVELOPE_DELIVERY
    Realtime->>DB: Save Opaque Envelope (message_envelopes)
    Realtime->>BobApp: WSS Route ENVELOPE_DELIVERY Payload
    BobApp->>BobApp: Decrypt Payload locally
    BobApp-->>Realtime: WSS ACK_DELIVERY
    Realtime-->>AliceApp: Update UI to "Delivered" (Double Check)
